    <h1 style="text-align: center; color: var(--accent-color); margin-bottom: 40px;">🔒 Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="card">
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> <span class="highlight">January 1, 2024</span></p>
        <p>This Privacy Policy describes how ATIVE Casino Bot ("we", "our", "us", or "the Bot") collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you use our Discord bot services.</p>
