    <div class="card">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        
        <h3>1.1 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
        <p>When you interact with ATIVE Casino Bot, we automatically collect certain information:</p>
        
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Discord User ID:</strong> Your unique Discord identifier (required for bot functionality)</li>
            <li><strong>Username:</strong> Your Discord username and display name</li>
            <li><strong>Server Information:</strong> Discord server (guild) IDs where you use the Bot</li>
            <li><strong>Channel Information:</strong> Channel IDs where commands are executed</li>
            <li><strong>Command Usage:</strong> Commands you execute and their timestamps</li>
            <li><strong>Game Statistics:</strong> Your performance in various casino games</li>
            <li><strong>Virtual Currency:</strong> Your virtual coin balance and transaction history</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>1.2 Voluntarily Provided Information</h3>
        <p>You may voluntarily provide additional information through:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Support tickets and help requests</li>
            <li>Feedback and suggestions</li>
            <li>Bug reports</li>
            <li>Custom settings and preferences</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>1.3 Information We Do NOT Collect</h3>
        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> collect:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Private Discord messages (DMs)</li>
            <li>Message content in channels (unless using Bot commands)</li>
            <li>Personal identification information (real names, addresses, phone numbers)</li>
            <li>Payment information (handled by Discord for Server Products)</li>
            <li>Sensitive personal data</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
