        <h3>2.1 Primary Uses</h3>
        <p>We use collected information to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Provide Bot Services:</strong> Enable casino games, economy system, and commands</li>
            <li><strong>Game Functionality:</strong> Track scores, balances, and game progress</li>
            <li><strong>User Experience:</strong> Personalize interactions and maintain game state</li>
            <li><strong>Anti-Cheat:</strong> Detect and prevent exploitation or abuse</li>
            <li><strong>Support:</strong> Provide technical support and troubleshooting</li>
            <li><strong>Improvements:</strong> Analyze usage patterns to improve features</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>2.2 Analytics and Statistics</h3>
        <p>We may use aggregated, non-personal data for:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Understanding popular games and features</li>
            <li>Monitoring Bot performance and uptime</li>
            <li>Planning new features and updates</li>
            <li>Generating usage statistics and reports</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>2.3 Legal Compliance</h3>
        <p>We may use information when required by law or to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
            <li>Protect our rights and property</li>
            <li>Investigate potential violations of our Terms</li>
            <li>Ensure user and community safety</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

