        <p><strong>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties.</strong></p>

        <h3>3.2 Limited Sharing</h3>
        <p>We may share information only in the following circumstances:</p>
        
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Discord Platform:</strong> Information necessary for Bot functionality is shared with Discord</li>
            <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Trusted third-party services that help us operate the Bot (e.g., hosting, databases)</li>
            <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law, court order, or legal process</li>
            <li><strong>Safety and Security:</strong> To protect users, our services, or the public from harm</li>
            <li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In the unlikely event of a merger, acquisition, or asset sale</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>3.3 Public Information</h3>
        <p>Some information may be publicly visible:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Leaderboard rankings (username and scores only)</li>
            <li>Tournament results and achievements</li>
            <li>Public game statistics (when you choose to share)</li>
        </ul>
