        <h3>4.1 Security Measures</h3>
        <p>We implement various security measures to protect your information:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Encryption:</strong> Data transmission is encrypted using industry-standard protocols</li>
            <li><strong>Access Controls:</strong> Limited access to personal data on a need-to-know basis</li>
            <li><strong>Regular Audits:</strong> Periodic security reviews and updates</li>
            <li><strong>Secure Hosting:</strong> Data stored on secure, reputable hosting platforms</li>
            <li><strong>Monitoring:</strong> Continuous monitoring for security threats</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4.2 Data Retention</h3>
        <p>We retain your information for different periods based on data type:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account Data:</strong> Until you request deletion or stop using the Bot</li>
            <li><strong>Game Statistics:</strong> Up to 2 years for historical records</li>
            <li><strong>Transaction Logs:</strong> Up to 3 years for fraud prevention</li>
            <li><strong>Support Tickets:</strong> Up to 1 year after resolution</li>
            <li><strong>Error Logs:</strong> Up to 6 months for debugging purposes</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4.3 Data Backup and Recovery</h3>
        <p>We maintain regular backups to prevent data loss, with backups subject to the same security standards as primary data storage.</p>
